WEBVTT

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:25.600
Not here, either...

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:30.040
Honestly! How far did ol' Hosei run off
to after getting bent out of shape?

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:34.010
He's still such a handful to deal with...

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:48.090
Heya. How are you feeling?

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:51.800
You!

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:53.930
Don't be so cross!

00:00:53.930 --> 00:00:57.700
I left you alive. You really
ought to be <i>thanking</i> me.

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:59.690
Like hell I will, you bastard!

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:04.710
Divine Warrior Phecda.

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:06.870
Kill the Alkaid.

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:16.090
Kill the Alkaid... Kill Taito?!

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:18.890
Quit talking nonsense!
Why would I do that?!

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:23.300
Refuse and I kill you <i>and</i> your master.

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:24.920
My master?!

00:01:26.470 --> 00:01:29.270
Decide quickly.

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:33.610
Kill the Alkaid and live,
or refuse and die.

00:01:33.610 --> 00:01:38.340
It's a simple one-or-the-other decision
unless you're exceptionally dimwitted.

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:44.850
Yeah... It's probably simple
for anyone not as stupid as Taito...

00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:46.840
My answer is this!

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:56.360
Like I'd ever take orders from you!

00:01:56.360 --> 00:02:00.460
Just try and kill me
and my master, if you dare!

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:16.840
<i>Those guys ain't normal!</i>
<i>What now?! What do I do?!</i>

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:25.190
Watch over the place
while we're gone, Lady Laila.

00:02:25.190 --> 00:02:28.690
Okay. I just hope Hosei turns up soon...

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:32.300
I'm more concerned about Lady Koei.

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:34.800
She's been in the mountains for a long time.

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:37.240
Even if she does know
the area well, it's still worrying.

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:39.910
There's no other choice.
We need to make sure she's okay.

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:41.740
We'll be back soon.

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:55.690
This feeling...

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:58.920
I see. So you're the reason for
the unpleasant appearance of the stars...

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:00.480
...Shimei.

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:06.500
It makes me happy to know
that a beautiful woman remembers me.

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:11.090
For a 40 year-old mortal,
your youthfulness is really something!

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:14.110
I'm still 39.

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:17.440
You look much worse
than you used to, though.

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:23.620
Don't be like that. This body's
just like you: it used to be a bandit.

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:27.120
But maybe I'll be more selective
the next time I get a new one.

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:31.020
Oh, yes. I ran into your pupil.

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:34.030
What did you to do Hosei?

00:03:34.030 --> 00:03:39.300
I haven't done anything. I only
asked him to kill the Alkaid, that's all.

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:42.970
I said I'd kill his master if he didn't do it.

00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:44.800
And his reply?

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:48.600
He told me to go ahead and try, if I dare.

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:58.050
Let me ask you this.
What do you think of the Alkaid boy?

00:03:58.050 --> 00:04:01.590
Do you think he'll be good
amusement for me down the road?

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:05.460
Taito will never give in
to you, no matter what.

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:10.560
Nor will Laila, Ryuko or Hosei!

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:13.550
I see. Sounds fun.

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:21.160
What happened?
There isn't even any wind...

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:27.780
Help, Laila!

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:32.010
Damn, they're stubborn!

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:37.190
I'm saved!

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:40.630
--Hey!
--Hosei!

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:42.290
Where the heck did you go?!

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:43.830
Where is Lady Koei?!

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:46.100
My master?! What about her?!

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:50.970
You dumbass! She went into
the mountains to look for <i>you</i>!

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:53.160
She never came back,
so now <i>we're</i> here!

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:57.430
--They're all yours!
--H-hold on, Hosei!

00:05:02.050 --> 00:05:03.980
That damn Hosei...

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:13.690
He only makes more
and more work for us.

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:14.690
Wh-what?!

00:05:14.690 --> 00:05:17.990
What are you doing,
Ryuko?! Hit 'em right!

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:29.470
Wha--?! But I hit 'em squarely!

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:31.840
These are no ordinary people!

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:33.400
So it would seem!

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:38.910
<i>Where are you, Master?!</i>

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:44.050
Master!

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:49.190
Where were you?

00:05:49.190 --> 00:05:52.700
You know running off and
not coming back will worry me.

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:56.700
Well, I <i>was</i> going to come back,
but then stuff happened...

00:05:56.700 --> 00:06:01.410
I'm sorry, Master!
I sulked for no good reason!

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:04.580
You're so foolish.
There's no need to apologize.

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:07.770
Give me a break!
I <i>want</i> to apologize!

00:06:13.550 --> 00:06:15.090
Here.

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:16.690
What are you doing?

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:19.420
Just get on. You look exhausted.

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:21.290
Maybe it's your age showing!

00:06:22.890 --> 00:06:28.270
Okay, hurry up!
Taito and the others are waiting!

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:29.860
Hosei...

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:35.640
Okay, I'm counting on you...

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:37.630
Just leave it to me!

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.780
You're lighter than I expected, Master!

00:06:41.780 --> 00:06:45.420
Of course I am! I <i>am</i> skinny!

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:49.620
I've never done something like this
before. It's kind of embarrassing.

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:54.260
Say, Master.

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:59.830
Do you think I could go to the capital
with Laila and the others?

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:05.170
What a silly question. You know
pupils need to leave the nest someday.

00:07:05.170 --> 00:07:07.840
You still know so little about the world.

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:10.840
You need to visit the capital
and learn much more.

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:12.440
Yeah...

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:16.350
Hosei. Take good care
of Taito and the others...

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:19.450
Wh-what brought that on all of a sudden?

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:24.490
It <i>was</i> the karma of the stars
that brought you together.

00:07:24.490 --> 00:07:27.190
But there are also bonds between people.

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:28.660
Bonds...

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:31.700
You all feel it.

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:36.690
Even without the karma of the stars,
you feel something resonating between you.

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:42.770
Oh, yeah! Master! I ran into
some really tough guys earlier!

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:47.780
Every time I'd beat 'em down they'd get
right back up like it was nothing!

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:50.620
Those would be the undead...

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:52.020
Undead?!

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:56.120
Yes... People who have already died...

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:59.020
There's no way to beat
them in a normal fight...

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:00.890
Then is there no way at all?!

00:08:00.890 --> 00:08:03.860
There's just one way...

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:05.530
Between the eyebrows...

00:08:05.530 --> 00:08:09.070
If you strike between the eyebrows,
the undead will return to the earth...

00:08:09.070 --> 00:08:12.170
Between the eyebrows?!
Got it, Master!

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:15.670
I guess you knowing everything
isn't all talk after all!

00:08:15.670 --> 00:08:21.650
Of course it isn't. I'm Koei...
the fount of knowledge...

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:24.840
Yeah! I'm proud to have you as my master!

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:32.850
Oh, geez. You fall asleep
the one time I praise you?

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:37.930
So she finally kicked the bucket...

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:42.920
I'm surprised she lasted
that long with a wound like that...

00:08:54.350 --> 00:08:57.580
Now things are going to get fun!

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:01.190
What the hell were you thinking, Hosei?!

00:09:01.190 --> 00:09:05.020
Leaving us with those undead guys
and running off like that...!

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:11.030
Yes. We're just lucky that they
eventually retreated for some reason.

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:12.700
Had they continued to fight us...

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:15.430
C'mon, don't be like that.

00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:18.240
You're sitting here eating
breakfast safe and sound now.

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:20.610
Right, Laila?!

00:09:20.610 --> 00:09:26.240
I agree with them about you
having a bad attitude!

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:29.250
She put it so harshly! She loves me!

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:30.980
No, she doesn't!

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:35.050
In any case, we're in trouble
if they attack again tonight.

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:38.960
We should take Lady Koei and leave while
the sun is still out, or something of the sort...

00:09:38.960 --> 00:09:41.430
No need.

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:43.050
What do you mean?

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:50.630
I doubt you guys know, but there
<i>is</i> a way to kill the undead.

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:52.900
Between the eyebrows.

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:55.470
Hit here and even the strongest
undead is as good as--

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:57.500
You're wrong, Hosei.

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:02.480
You beat the undead by hitting the heart.

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:04.750
Do you not listen to what other people say?

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:07.350
Huh? But you said
"between the eyes" last night!

00:10:07.350 --> 00:10:09.580
You misheard.

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:16.190
I <i>thought</i> it was strange that you were
suddenly knowledgeable, Hosei!

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:19.160
Man, you didn't even
get the facts straight!

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:21.800
N-no! I swear that's what she said--

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:24.940
Koei wouldn't make a mistake like that.

00:10:24.940 --> 00:10:26.700
You're the one who's mistaken, Hosei.

00:10:26.700 --> 00:10:29.540
Believe me, Laila!

00:10:45.220 --> 00:10:46.660
No good...

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:52.730
I put so much into it
that my arm hurts now.

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:54.670
I did it so well yesterday too...

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:57.070
Shall we change things up a little?

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:00.230
Koei!

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:03.040
Follow me.

00:11:14.550 --> 00:11:15.650
What is this place?

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:19.390
A training ground Hosei used to use.

00:11:19.390 --> 00:11:24.230
Oh? So ol' Hosei trained
in a place like this?

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:30.200
Say, Koei. What was Hosei
like when he was a kid?

00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:37.580
I-is this the new training you mentioned?

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:40.010
Doesn't it seem a bit too serious to you?

00:11:50.050 --> 00:11:51.420
Hosei!

00:11:51.420 --> 00:11:53.060
You okay, Taito?!

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:54.890
How did you guys--?!

00:11:54.890 --> 00:11:57.130
It's thanks to Ryuko!

00:11:57.130 --> 00:11:59.460
I was suspicious ever since this morning.

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:01.700
Hosei is a skilled warrior.

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:04.640
I don't know about anything else,
but it's very hard to believe

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:07.540
he would incorrectly remember
knowledge related to fighting.

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:12.380
So if Hosei is correct, then the
suspicion lies elsewhere...

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:14.710
That Lady Koei is a fake!

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:15.610
What?!

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:19.610
Oh, my. You figured it out?

00:12:21.890 --> 00:12:23.890
You're the mustached bastard's henchman!

00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:26.480
I should've known
you were behind this, Shimei!

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:30.960
But there's one mistake in your theory.

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:33.770
She isn't a fake at all.

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:37.170
You're controlling her, then?!

00:12:37.170 --> 00:12:41.770
She has nothing to do with this!
Release your spell at once!

00:12:41.770 --> 00:12:44.780
I'm afraid I can't do that.

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:46.810
Quit screwing around!
Turn her back to normal!

00:12:46.810 --> 00:12:48.680
I told you, I can't.

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:50.250
The reason being...

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:51.270
Master!

00:13:01.190 --> 00:13:03.160
Wh-what the hell?!

00:13:03.160 --> 00:13:05.800
M-Master!

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:07.700
Phecda boy.

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:13.970
How did it feel when your oh-so-beloved
master died on your back?

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:16.140
Wh-what?!

00:13:16.140 --> 00:13:18.480
Y-you don't mean...!

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:20.610
Yep, that's right!

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:24.050
She's been an undead since last night!

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:31.620
Wh-what...?!

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:43.870
This... This can't be...

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:45.740
She was really noble!

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:52.180
Even after I stabbed her, she kept
telling me not to hurt you guys.

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:55.010
Not that I care, of course.

00:13:55.010 --> 00:13:57.540
Damn you...!

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:01.590
There we are! Hate!

00:14:01.590 --> 00:14:04.920
That hate is what I want to see!

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:06.690
No, Taito!

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:12.830
Taito!

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:15.260
Oh no! He's in that state again!

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.070
That's it! That's it, Alkaid!

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:38.890
No, Taito! Your body can't
withstand any more fighting like this!

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:43.090
Taito! Have you forgotten
what Koei taught you?!

00:14:43.090 --> 00:14:46.690
She said not to fight out of hatred alone!
She said to stay calm and collected!

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:54.930
Urgh! Wake up, you dumb brother!

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:06.550
That's right...

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:11.960
If I don't do what she taught me,
I'll be too ashamed to face Koei...

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:13.790
Right, Laila?

00:15:17.800 --> 00:15:19.830
This is no fun.

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:21.300
Oh well.

00:15:21.300 --> 00:15:23.300
They're all yours, Koei!

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:24.840
You're running away?!

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:28.310
Yes, I am. But what about you?

00:15:28.310 --> 00:15:32.810
Even though she's undead,
she's still an acquaintance of yours.

00:15:32.810 --> 00:15:35.340
Do you have what it takes to re-kill her?

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:39.580
Look out!

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:42.120
K-Koei...

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:45.290
His spell has made her stronger!

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:47.020
Such strength...

00:15:50.160 --> 00:15:51.460
Ryuko!

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:52.860
Stop it!

00:15:58.040 --> 00:15:59.870
Taito! Ryuko!

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:01.500
Hosei!

00:16:03.170 --> 00:16:05.340
Master...

00:16:05.340 --> 00:16:08.440
My... master...

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:14.790
I can't do it!

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:21.360
I can't do it, Laila!
I can't fight my master!

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:23.290
Hosei!

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:27.970
We've been together
ever since I was a little kid!

00:16:27.970 --> 00:16:30.540
Plus, this never would've happened

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:34.040
if I hadn't gotten bent out of
shape for nothing last night...

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:38.380
I... can't possibly do it!

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:40.480
Then what do we do?!

00:16:40.480 --> 00:16:41.980
I don't know!

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:47.520
E-even so, we can't just let her kill us...!

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:52.350
Yeah...! Koei wouldn't want that...!

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:58.650
But... But...!

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:05.340
That's...

00:17:07.570 --> 00:17:09.340
You call that a shot, Hosei?!

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:11.780
B-but, Master...

00:17:11.780 --> 00:17:13.380
No buts!

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:17.920
Try harder and shoot with the intent
to take it down with one arrow!

00:17:17.920 --> 00:17:20.210
No food until you hit it!

00:17:34.230 --> 00:17:39.730
<i>Master</i>... <i>Don't tell me you're purposely</i>
<i>standing in front of the target</i>...<i>?!</i>

00:17:47.950 --> 00:17:53.280
Are you... Are you telling me
to shoot you, Master?!

00:17:54.220 --> 00:17:58.590
That's horrible, Master...
That's horrible!

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:01.820
After all, my feelings
for you go deeper than...

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:13.000
Why is it I'm the only one
you're so harsh with, Master...?

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:31.590
Hosei! We won't make you do this alone!

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:34.180
We will all bear this sin equally!

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:40.190
<i>Master</i>...

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:44.290
<i>I thank you for</i>...

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:53.500
...<i>for</i>...

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:01.890
You did it, Hosei!

00:19:01.890 --> 00:19:04.490
What's with you, Master?

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:09.060
You did great! I'll make you
whatever you want to eat today!

00:19:09.060 --> 00:19:10.660
What would you like?

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:13.130
Hmm...

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:14.960
Green pepper steak!

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:18.670
You sure do like that!

00:20:03.110 --> 00:20:05.050
Dumb old hag...

00:20:11.190 --> 00:20:15.390
Dumb old hag!

00:20:21.760 --> 00:20:25.800
<i>Even with unhealed sadness,</i>
<i>the journey begins again</i>.

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:28.770
<i>My master</i>... <i>My master is calling</i>...

00:20:28.770 --> 00:20:31.470
<i>We can't keep going on like this</i>...

00:20:31.470 --> 00:20:34.270
<i>He did strike down his master</i>
<i>who was like a mother to him</i>...

00:20:34.270 --> 00:20:37.470
<i>Then let's just figure out</i>
<i>a way to help him!</i>

00:20:37.470 --> 00:20:40.040
<i>I'm sure some encouragement from you</i>
<i>would cheer him up a little, Lady Laila</i>.

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:42.610
<i>He said he wanted to be alone for a while</i>.

00:20:42.610 --> 00:20:46.320
<i>Will the voices of Hosei's friends</i>
<i>be able to bring light to his heart?</i>

00:20:46.320 --> 00:20:50.580
<i>On Hero Tales, "Chapter Eight:</i>
<i>What Echoes in the Gorge."</i>
